{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>You will bring them and plant them.</b> So that they will not be exiled from it." "<b>In the mountain of Your inheritance.</b> The mountain of the Temple, concerning which it says: בְּהַר ה' יֵרָאֶה (Genesis 22:14)." "<b>A dwelling-place for Your seat, YHWH, You have made.</b> As it says (Psalms 132:14): פֹּה אֵשֵׁב כִּי אִוִּתִיהָ." "<b>The sanctuary of YHWH — Your hands established.</b> As He said: וְעָשׂוּ לִי מִקְדָּשׁ (Exodus 25:8), כְּכָל אֲשֶׁר אֲנִי מַרְאֶה אוֹתָךְ (Exodus 25:9). And likewise David said: הַכֹּל בִּכְתָב מִיַּד ה' עָלַי הִשְׂכִּיל (I Chronicles 28:19), concerning all the works of the pattern."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:25:41.906725061Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}